# Implementation Plan - Dynamic AI Agent Reasoning via Google Gemini

We will upgrade the hardcoded rule-based backend with Google's Gemini LLM to create a genuinely intelligent, dynamic logistics agent. This will enable the system to handle any unstructured news or disruption reports, analyze impact on active shipments, and generate realistic counter-measures.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To run the updated system, you will need to obtain a **Gemini API Key** from Google AI Studio and place it in a `.env` file under the `backend/` directory as `GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here`.

